      "answerIds": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "explanation": [
        {
          "text": "Augmented never relocates — every major grip has its augmented twin one fret away in the same place. Diminished does relocate twice: on strings 3-4-5 in root position and on strings 2-3-4 in first inversion, both because the "
        },
        {
